architecture context-cut-compiler
  canonical_name ContextCutCompiler
  owns ContextCutManifest
  owns PurposeBoundContext
  consumes RankedCandidateEnvelope
  consumes ReceiptBoundMaterialManifest
  consumes ExactOwnerQueryEvidence
  consumes InformationPolicyClass
  publishes ContextCutManifest
  publishes PurposeBoundContext
  publishes DecisionCaseFrontier
  family context
  domain Context / physical compilation
  layer execution
  semantic_question Which exactly receipted material bodies from the currently bounded candidate frontier fit this purpose and token budget?
  purpose Compile a recoverable model context from an AddressPlane-bounded learned frontier after exact owners have supplied receipt-bound material, tokenizing each content-addressed body once under an explicit GigaToken tokenizer passport.
  maturity implemented
  node_types ContextCutManifest
  node_types ReceiptBoundMaterial
  node_types TokenizerPassport
  edge_types contains_material
  edge_types omits_by_budget
  invariant only a current ADMIT ranked frontier may enter an executable context cut
  invariant a current SHADOW ranked frontier may produce a separately labelled diagnostic token/cache receipt only; it cannot project to an executing model, lowerer or carrier
  invariant a complete external ProviderEmbeddingRank may enter only through ProviderFrontier's current AddressPlane recheck plus matching ForeignTwin exact-owner ledger, remains labelled provider_embedding_rank rather than BitNet, and is diagnostic until a separately admitted representation/execution plan exists
  invariant every selected body rehashes to its declared ForeignTwin receipt digest before tokenization
  invariant when an ExactOwnerQueryEvidence ledger is supplied, a body may enter the context only after that ledger records an observed result from the declared ForeignTwin verifier; the receipt/body rehash remains a separate required check
  invariant a cached token body is keyed by immutable body CID and complete tokenizer passport, while every new cut rechecks current AddressPlane descriptor, receipt digest, and InformationPolicy before referencing it
  invariant GigaToken materialization obtains and releases a transient ResourceAdmission grant; that physical grant is neither a selected candidate nor evidence, authority, proof, or effect permission
  invariant the native GigaToken batch bridge is built from the pinned 0.10 source core without Python bindings; an unavailable or failed encoder refuses the cut and releases its transient ResourceAdmission grant
  invariant a body shared by several selected semantic references is tokenized once but retains every reference in the manifest
  invariant ordinary compilation tokenizes the exact ranked prefix first and leaves unreachable suffix bodies unencoded when the prefix fills the candidate cap; missing or over-budget prefix material triggers one suffix batch without changing ranked selection or receipt validation
  witness cmd/BonfyreContextCut/tests/context_cut_test.sh measures one of two unique bodies avoided on the full-prefix fixture and zero native calls on cache reuse; a budget-constrained fallback retains identical selected identities, context and token digests while explicitly reporting its extra native batch
  invariant an over-budget or not-yet-materialized candidate remains a recoverable frontier member rather than becoming impossible
  invariant InformationPolicyClass is checked before any body crosses into the context representation
  invariant a nonempty explicit purpose is bound into every compiled ContextCut, which publishes a reconstructable receipt-bound DecisionCase frontier without another resident copy of source text or a hosted model call
  invariant a selected body too large for one authored decision state is split into deterministic bounded digest-bound chunks; no model sees a silently truncated body, and the original ContextCut remains intact
  forbidden_inference a context cut -> sufficient evidence for a mission
  forbidden_inference an exact retained-observation query -> semantic relevance, source truth, admitted institutional fact, proof, authority, or effect permission
  forbidden_inference a learned rank -> selected, authorized, or semantically true candidate
  forbidden_inference a SHADOW diagnostic context -> executable model context, lowerer handoff or carrier payload
  source_path cmd/BonfyreContextCut/context_cut.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/frontier-adapters.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreContextCut/gigatoken-native/src/main.rs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreProviderFrontier/src/main.c
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLoweringWorkers/src/main.c
  witness cmd/BonfyreContextCut/tests/context_cut_test.sh executes the native GigaToken core with the real Qwen2.5-Coder tokenizer under a declared passport
  witness cmd/BonfyreContextCut/tests/context_cut_test.sh proves the normal compiler publishes a purpose-bound reconstructable DecisionCase frontier which can be planned without a hosted call while the original ContextCut stays intact
  witness cmd/BonfyreContextCut/tests/live_shadow_parity.test.mjs replays the persisted bitnet:1789271781 SHADOW frontier through the native compiler and matches the prior 29,848 token IDs, exact token and context digests, selected identities and spans
  witness cmd/BonfyreLoweringWorkers/tests/lowering_workers_test.sh proves MaterialCompiler refuses a SHADOW rank without an explicit diagnostic request, atomically emits only a digest-verified ForeignTwin receipt whose identity intersects the persisted frontier, and accepts that body under the stronger path only after native ForeignTwin query evidence records the exact candidate as observed
  witness /Users/nickgonzales/.bonfyre/estate/bitnet-shadow-context.json records the live bitnet:1789271781 SHADOW path over 92 persisted candidates: MaterialCompiler retained exactly two receipt-rehashed bodies, GigaToken produced 29,848 Qwen-token IDs under the named passport, and ResourceAdmission released its transient grant before artifact publication; replay at bitnet-shadow-context-reused.json preserves the context/token digests with two cache hits and zero misses
  witness /Users/nickgonzales/.bonfyre/estate/bitnet-exact-shadow-context.json repeats that live ContextCut through /Users/nickgonzales/.bonfyre/estate/bitnet-exact-owner-evidence.jsonl: native ForeignTwin queried all 92 persisted BitNet candidates and only the two observed retained bodies reached the same digest-stable 29,848-token SHADOW context
  witness /Users/nickgonzales/.bonfyre/estate/representation-runs/mistral-bitnet-frontier-20260915/context/weather-provider-full-ledger-rechecked-diagnostic.json records a live ResourceAdmission-gated GigaToken cut over a real Mistral 1,024-dimensional rank of the prior 128-member AddressPlane frontier: the complete 16-row ProviderFrontier ledger retained four exact ForeignTwin negatives and twelve observed receipt-bound bodies; the SHADOW provider_embedding_rank cut produced 790,936 Qwen2.5 token IDs with twelve CID×tokenizer cache hits and zero lowerer or model execution
  known_gap the native GigaToken bridge builds against an external pinned local source tree; relocatable packaging and a deploy-host build receipt remain open

interaction bitnet-frontier-compiles-gigatoken-context-cut
  source bitnet-address-ranker
  destination context-cut-compiler
  relation ranked-receipted-material-context-compilation
  preserves the bounded AddressPlane frontier order, current candidate identity/type/owner/verifier/lowerer envelope, receipt digest, evidence reference, information policy class, temporal frontier and tokenizer passport
  drops model vector values, learned score as a truth claim, unmaterialized candidates, owner state beyond the supplied receipt-bound material, authority, proof, commitment and effect state
  forbidden_inference a GigaToken context body -> source evidence is proven, an omitted body is impossible, a selected candidate is authorized, or a model may execute an effect
  invalidates_on address advertisement drift, rank representation withdrawal, ForeignTwin receipt digest change, information policy change, temporal frontier change or tokenizer passport change
  witness cmd/BonfyreContextCut/tests/context_cut_test.sh
  binding cmd/BonfyreContextCut/context_cut.mjs

interaction gigatoken-native-encodes-context-cut
  source gigatoken
  destination context-cut-compiler
  relation native-receipted-body-tokenization
  preserves exact body bytes after declared UTF-8 replacement, pinned tokenizer bytes, ordered GigaToken token IDs and u32le token-body encoding
  drops Python interpreter and binding objects, source authority, semantic relevance, admission judgment, and effect permission
  forbidden_inference token ID parity -> source truth, authorized use, sufficient evidence, or production packaging
  invalidates_on GigaToken source revision, tokenizer byte digest, body CID, batch protocol, or tokenization implementation change
  witness cmd/BonfyreContextCut/tests/live_shadow_parity.test.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreContextCut/gigatoken-native/src/main.rs

interaction material-compiler-bounds-bitnet-context-material
  source address-plane
  destination context-cut-compiler
  relation retained-foreign-body-intersection
  preserves only persisted ranked identity, rank gate state, receipt-bound body path and digest, receipt digest, declared policy class, and temporal frontier
  drops learned score, vector body, unretained candidates, external URL execution, authority, proof, carrier action, lowerer enactment, and effect capability
  forbidden_inference a retained material intersection -> source truth, semantic relevance, ranked candidate selection, executable context from a SHADOW rank, authority, proof, or effect
  invalidates_on rank run/gate change, retained ForeignTwin receipt/body digest change, information policy change, or ContextCut manifest schema change
  witness cmd/BonfyreLoweringWorkers/tests/lowering_workers_test.sh
  binding cmd/BonfyreLoweringWorkers/src/main.c

interaction provider-frontier-compiles-diagnostic-gigatoken-context
  source provider-state
  destination context-cut-compiler
  relation provider-rank-exact-owner-context-compilation
  preserves ProviderEmbeddingRun/query/representation identifiers, rank order, current AddressPlane candidate identity/type/owner/verifier/lowerer envelope, exact ForeignTwin receipt/body digest, information policy class, temporal frontier and tokenizer passport
  drops provider vector values, provider score as semantic truth, unobserved candidates, authority, proof, commitment, carrier action, lowerer enactment and model execution
  forbidden_inference a complete provider embedding rank -> an admitted model representation, a selected candidate, a lawful operation, source truth, proof, authority or effect
  invalidates_on provider run/query withdrawal, AddressPlane advertisement drift, ForeignTwin receipt/body digest change, information policy change, temporal frontier change or tokenizer passport change
  witness cmd/BonfyreProviderFrontier/tests/provider_frontier_test.sh
  binding cmd/BonfyreProviderFrontier/src/main.c
